bit-for-bit reproducible against the published SHA256SUMS.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Safety notice
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Flashing bootloaders and partition images can permanently brick a device.
Everything here was verified on one Xiaomi Mi Pad 1 (3 GB mod), but you are
responsible for your own hardware. In particular:

  * NEVER flash tos.img on mocha — it bricks the device.
  * NEVER write the GPT.
  * Keep a recovery path (fastboot + the read-only RAM installer) available.
